  "subject": "Stop pitching brands in the DMs \u2014 let them book you",
  "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\">\n<title>Get booked by real brands \u2014 CollabMarket</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#F4F4F7;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;\">\n<!-- preheader (hidden) -->\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;\">\n  Brands are already searching. Set your rates, get booked, get paid the day your work is approved.\n</div>\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#F4F4F7;\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:28px 16px;\">\n\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:600px;max-width:100%;background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 6px 30px rgba(11,11,15,0.06);\">\n\n    <!-- brand bar -->\n    <tr><td style=\"padding:22px 32px 18px;\">\n      <span style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#0B0B0F;\">Collab<span style=\"color:#6C5CE7;\">Market</span></span>\n    </td></tr>\n\n    <!-- hero image -->\n    <tr><td style=\"padding:0;\">\n      <img src=\"https://pixabay.com/get/g22ccc5e552897d6f120c35eff3fef2c68a17329b983b11488400eaaaaaf2e504fb8db9641ba1eb325802d44d83913ad07869db1f2272b468ea86a9d4dfac874f_1280.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"Creator filming content\"\n           style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;\">\n    </td></tr>\n\n    <!-- headline -->\n    <tr><td style=\"padding:34px 32px 0;\">\n      <h1 style=\"margin:0;font-size:30px;line-height:1.18;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#0B0B0F;\">\n        Stop pitching brands in the DMs.<br>Let them book <span style=\"color:#6C5CE7;\">you</span>.\n      </h1>\n      <p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#6B7280;\">\n        You make the content. We bring the brands, handle the contract, and make sure\n        you actually get paid. No agency cut. No three-month wait. No ghosting.\n      </p>\n    </td></tr>\n\n    <!-- CTA 1 -->\n    <tr><td style=\"padding:26px 32px 8px;\">\n      <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n        <tr><td style=\"border-radius:12px;background:#0B0B0F;\">\n          <a href=\"https://www.collabmarket.in/auth/register\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:15px 28px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:12px;\">\n            Claim your creator profile \u2014 free \u2192\n          </a>\n        </td></tr>\n      </table>\n      <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#6B7280;\">\n        Free to join \u00b7 No credit card \u00b7 Takes about 4 minutes\n      </p>\n    </td></tr>\n\n    <!-- divider -->\n    <tr><td style=\"padding:30px 32px 0;\"><div style=\"height:1px;background:#ECECF1;\"></div></td></tr>\n\n    <!-- benefit: get paid -->\n    <tr><td style=\"padding:28px 32px 0;\">\n      <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n        <tr>\n          <td valign=\"top\" width=\"120\" style=\"padding-right:18px;\">\n            <img src=\"https://pixabay.com/get/g257c1087d5535796f7374e27540d6c953d837a049329632cd8dd5fd121963c9036b27f81a6301b345a81758423787d03ef92da5e556a154672082e911caf7711_1280.jpg\" width=\"120\" alt=\"Paid\"\n                 style=\"display:block;width:120px;height:90px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:12px;border:0;\">\n          </td>\n          <td valign=\"top\">\n            <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#00D1B2;\">Paid on approval</p>\n            <p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#0B0B0F;\">The money's already in escrow before you film.</p>\n            <p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#6B7280;\">\n              Brands fund the deal up front. The day they approve your content, it's released to you. You never chase an invoice again.\n            </p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n    </td></tr>\n\n    <!-- benefit: get found -->\n    <tr><td style=\"padding:22px 32px 0;\">\n      <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n        <tr>\n          <td valign=\"top\" width=\"120\" style=\"padding-right:18px;\">\n            <img src=\"https://pixabay.com/get/g23e5d90979d05e290e188fbeaa6bb25cff06479f1a0b90c57a5bdce20ea6f8707d47ce521226442c58e1d99057f441d1fa24b67b2d827fb41eec94b98493eb68_1280.jpg\" width=\"120\" alt=\"Get found\"\n                 style=\"display:block;width:120px;height:90px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:12px;border:0;\">\n          </td>\n          <td valign=\"top\">\n            <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C5CE7;\">Get discovered</p>\n            <p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#0B0B0F;\">Brands search by niche, audience and rate \u2014 and find you.</p>\n            <p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#6B7280;\">\n              Set your packages once. Our AI matches you to campaigns that fit your audience, so the right brands land in your inbox instead of the wrong ones.\n            </p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n    </td></tr>\n\n    <!-- proof line -->\n    <tr><td style=\"padding:28px 32px 0;\">\n      <div style=\"background:#FAFAFD;border:1px solid #ECECF1;border-radius:14px;padding:18px 20px;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#0B0B0F;\">\n          \u201cI used to chase brands in my DMs and wait months to get paid. Now serious brands book me here and I get paid the day my content is approved.\u201d\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:8px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#6B7280;\">\u2014 Layla H., lifestyle creator</p>\n      </div>\n    </td></tr>\n\n    <!-- CTA 2 -->\n    <tr><td style=\"padding:28px 32px 4px;\" align=\"center\">\n      <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\">\n        <tr><td style=\"border-radius:12px;background:#6C5CE7;\">\n          <a href=\"https://www.collabmarket.in/auth/register\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:16px 34px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:12px;\">\n            Join CollabMarket \u2014 it's free\n          </a>\n        </td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </td></tr>\n    <tr><td style=\"padding:12px 32px 34px;\" align=\"center\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#6B7280;\">\n        Spots in each niche are limited so brands see quality first. Grab yours today.\n      </p>\n    </td></tr>\n\n    <!-- footer -->\n    <tr><td style=\"padding:22px 32px;background:#0B0B0F;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#A7A7B4;line-height:1.6;\">\n        CollabMarket \u2014 where creators get booked and paid.<br>\n        <a href=\"https://www.collabmarket.in\" style=\"color:#fff;text-decoration:none;\">collabmarket.in</a>\n        &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp;\n        <a href=\"{{unsubscribe_url}}\" style=\"color:#A7A7B4;text-decoration:underline;\">Unsubscribe</a>\n      </p>\n    </td></tr>\n\n  </table>\n\n  <p style=\"margin:18px 0 0;font-size:11px;color:#9AA0AB;\">You're receiving this because you create content brands want to work with.</p>\n\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
